{
  "about": "Harbour Street's fetched assets (renderer pass 2, owner decision D6: fetched by sha256, never committed): CC0 only, from the pinned official URLs, sha256-verified. `node scripts/showcase-assets.ts fetch --scene harbour-street` downloads them into .studio-dev/assets-cache/harbour-street/raw/ and writes the maps the scene reads (fetched/*) into .studio-dev/assets-cache/harbour-street/assets/ (`--install` also copies them into harbour/assets/fetched/, which Git ignores, for a Studio run). Without them the blockout draws its untextured stand-ins.",
